# What ivpn.sh needs, declared beside the only file here that knows this CLI, so swapping
# the VPN provider is one new adapter plus one line in fzf-vpn.sh and nothing else.
# Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason, and the collector stamps the consumer.
ivpn | path | ivpn | optional | the CLI behind the VPN picker on the IVPN backend
